Z||000005||Raydar||04-04-2001||01:49 PM||||Josh,<P>Keep in mind that the 87-88 nose has the round moulding. If your car has the grooved mouldings, you'll probably want to change those, too.  <P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 T-top Formula<BR>88 soon-to-be-V6 coupe||||reg||1
Z||000006||DRH||04-04-2001||02:24 PM||||As raydar mentioned the molding is different. I believe the rear molding is part of the rear bumper which means you may want the rear bumper off one of the same year cars mentioned. The reflector lights and lower part of these are different than the 84-86 coupes also. Personally I think they look better anyway. Maybe someone has a rear view picture of an 87-88 coupe or 88 Formula.||||reg||1
