Z||000012||Kelvin Vivian||04-04-2001||09:49 PM||||Tina wrote "My 86/6cyl. has that nose. But not the rounded molding."<P>T, I'm guessing that you have an 86 SE 2M6, which would have the front end like the car below which is an 87 SE. You should have an "aero" or GT-style front end. This would be consistent with your SE having the ribbed molding.<P>That is unless you car has been modified...<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1601741&a=12208700&p=44402882&Sequence=2&res=high">   <P>[This message has been edited by Kelvin Vivian (edited 04-04-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by Kelvin Vivian (edited 04-04-2001).]||||reg||1
